    "opening": "A business loan supplies cash that must be repaid under a contract. Compare what reaches the business, every required payment and the cash source for repayment. A lower monthly payment can come with a longer commitment and higher total cost. Start with the use of funds before comparing lenders or headline rates.",
    "answerHtml": "<p>A business loan supplies cash that must be repaid under a contract. Compare what reaches the business, every required payment and the cash source for repayment. A lower monthly payment can come with a longer commitment and higher total cost. Start with the use of funds before comparing lenders or headline rates.</p>",
