    "opening": "Employee compensation includes the pay and benefits offered to an employee; the business must also budget its own related employer costs. Compare packages on a consistent annual basis and keep employee take-home pay separate from employer expense. Paid hours, productive hours and first-year hiring cash answer different planning questions.",
    "answerHtml": "<p>Employee compensation includes the pay and benefits offered to an employee; the business must also budget its own related employer costs. Compare packages on a consistent annual basis and keep employee take-home pay separate from employer expense. Paid hours, productive hours and first-year hiring cash answer different planning questions.</p>",
